{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398750/extras/a3e153a11763ea4ca4e38e81261150d8.avif?t=1763847146\" width=878 height=8192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398750/extras/f6466c06692703dd3aaa2d2856f0941d.avif?t=1763847146\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398750/extras_big/f6466c06692703dd3aaa2d2856f0941d.avif?t=1763847146 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual &amp; Ranked PvP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle against opponents causally or competitively. Ranked seasons will be every 3 months, so craft powerful decks, crush your opponents and climb the ladder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build decks picking from any of the 7 elements to create endless and unique combos. Some cards feature dual-typing which open up an array of more combinations and deck building opportunities.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weakness &amp; Resistance System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage the elemental advantage by attacking an enemy's elemental weaknesses, or go on the defensive by leveraging elemental resistances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Void Pile</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Void Pile is a shared zone where cards are sent via card effect. Use card abilities or effects to use your opponent's cards against them and unleash even more combo potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep and Rich Customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've removed the limiters on customization, allowing you to customize mats, card borders, border colors, card skins, card backs, and even unlock unique VFX cosmetics, and more.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lore of Gear Slayer through the PvE story mode. You'll travel the different regions of Aurellia, unlock new heroes, face-off against powerful enemies, and go head to head with &quot;Void Raids&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Modes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be continually releasing new and exciting arcade modes, adding layers to the existing gameplay, and giving you more ways to play.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more....</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions &amp; Faction Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily &amp; Weekly Mission System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Promo Cards &amp; Special In-game Events</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398750?t=1763847146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3398750?t=1763847146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398750/b62b6d8e2e258f5c1c8cf3c6821edb96276bb6bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763847146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398750/b62b6d8e2e258f5c1c8cf3c6821edb96276bb6bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763847146","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Stats","id":15}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mature content of our game is limited only to somewhat revealing outfits for female characters. We do not display any explicit nudity across the game. "},"detailed_description":"<h1>SUPPORT US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_p